This is an OMP-transformed Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B tokenizer vocabulary, not the original
upstream tokenizer.json. ../tools/pack-qwen.ts decodes byte-alphabet vocabulary
keys, excludes 33 added tokens, preserves 248044 rank slots with 201 unreachable
entries emptied, and encodes the table as UTOK1 followed by zstd compression.
These transformations are present in OMP v18.4.8, commit
717f97f4d22b3d65c4a4eef6a744255d46f4d1a6. This notice was added on 2026-10-10;
the packed table was not modified or regenerated during that notice remediation.

The qwen3 output name is a family identifier; the source matched during this
review is Qwen3.8-27B at 1d4bf0f2ff6012fd82039f2fa52739d0dd7c60c0.
See README.md for the source URLs, cache hash, comparison method and limitations.
Keep this notice attached to the transformed table when redistributing it.
